              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 23:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Kayini ava imbere y’Uhoraho, aba mu gihugu c’i Nodi, ku ruhande rwa Edeni ahahera i burasirazuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Kayini abana n’umugore wiwe, asama inda, avyara Henoki, yubaka igisagara, acita Henoki, acitiranije n’ umwana wiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henoki avyara Iradi: Iradi avyara Mehuyayeli: Mehuyayeli avyara Metushayeli: Metushayeli avyara Lameki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lameki yābīra abagore babiri: umwe yitwa Ada uwundi Zila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ada avyara Yabalu, ni we sekuruza w’abungere b’inka bagenda baba mu mahema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murumuna we yitwa Yubalu, ni we sekuruza w’abavuzi b’inanga n’imyironge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zila na we avyara Tubali‐Kayini, umucuzi w’ikintu cose c’ubugi kiva mu miringa no mu vyuma. Mushiki wa Tubali‐Kayini ni Nayama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lameki abarira abagore biwe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
